                                        "entry_id": "3e16477b-1a27-39c4-acb8-af63bbcec3aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A compound of the avermectin group, used as an anthelmintic in veterinary medicine and as a treatment for river blindness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e844ae2-e7ed-4db1-85eb-e3a183958134",
                                                "sense_id": "2b86eb86-f626-3e1e-8ce2-a01d9800e930",
                                                "text": "Dr. Yu has refused the ivermectin requests, he said, but he knows some of his colleagues have not."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cdc6c3ee-70d1-4e86-95cd-9f979c61d78f",
                                                "sense_id": "2b86eb86-f626-3e1e-8ce2-a01d9800e930",
                                                "text": "Perhaps the most egregious example of shifting the standards of evidence comes when the report discusses the off-label use of drugs such as chloroquine and ivermectin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
